# Files to exclude from `vercel deploy` uploads (gitignore-style patterns).
# Critical: local `.env` files must never ship — secrets would land in the
# deployment filesystem (dotenv would even load them at runtime). Runtime
# config comes from `vercel env` instead.
.env
.env*.local
# Regenerated on every build (see vercel.json buildCommand) — uploading the
# local copy would just waste 20MB+ and risk a stale Prisma engine.
api/.bundle
.turbo
*.log
